              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Joby"
            },
            "reviewBody": "What a refreshing salad! My store didn't have green grapes, so I used red. With the blue cheese dressing and walnuts, everyone raved about it. Next time, I would add blue cheese chunks to give it an extra kick."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
