            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TxCin2"
            },
            "reviewBody": "No. This was not good at all. I love grapes. I love walnuts. I can tolerate Blue Cheese dressing and actually like it in the right setting. This was not a good combination. Sorry this did not work for me. I didn't need a second bite to confirm. I think the grapes and walnuts are fine, it's that strong sour blue cheese dressing that isn't working in this dish.",
