              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "nobugging"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used red grapes. I made the mistake of pouring dressing directly into the salad instead of measuring, and I over-poured. It was too rich like that and I didn't have enough grapes and walnuts to double the recipe, so I added some diced celery. Turned out lovely looking and tasting!",
